      "value": "Thank you for your report!\n\n18 months ago, in August 2021, VRChat switched to Unity 2019. Since then, we've been recommending the switch to Unity 2019.\n\nIf you need help upgrading to Unity 2019, please refer to the migration guide in our documentation: https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/migrating-from-2018-lts-to-2019-lts\n\nNote that you'll need to download our Legacy SDK for the initial upgrade.\n\nPlease let us know if you have any questions.",
